NXP replaced the Micron MT53E1G16D1FW 1CS DRAM on the i.MX93 FRDM
with JSC JSL4BAG167ZAMF 2CS DRAM after the former reached end of life.

Import the timing data for the new DRAM from NXP's U-Boot commit
4c35a6086ae ("LFU-956 imx93_frdm: Add 2CS 2GB DRAM support on i.MX93 FRDM").

The imported timings are adapted for barebox in a subsequent commit.

Link: https://github.com/nxp-imx/uboot-imx/commit/4c35a6086aedca2f6220382920242ad81ae372f6
Signed-off-by: Freimut Diener <f.diener@pengutronix.de>
